---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const lastUpdated = 'July 4, 2026';
---
<BaseLayout title="Contact" description="Contact UFO Declassified — questions, corrections, tips, and media inquiries.">
  <section class="container-narrow py-12 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <div class="section-header">
      <h1 class="font-display text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider">Contact</h1>
    </div>
    <p class="text-space-400 text-xs font-mono mb-8">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

    <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none space-y-6 text-space-200 text-sm">

      <p>
        We welcome questions, corrections, tips, and media inquiries about the declassified UAP documents
        indexed on this site. Whether you spotted a metadata error, want to request coverage of a specific
        record, or are a journalist working on a PURSUE-related story — please reach out.
      </p>

      <div class="glass-panel p-6 my-8">
        <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-white mb-3 uppercase tracking-wider">Email</h2>
        <p class="mb-3">
          <strong class="text-white">General inquiries & corrections:</strong><br />
          <a href="mailto:contact@ufo-declassified.com" class="text-cyan-bright hover:underline">contact@ufo-declassified.com</a>
        </p>
        <p class="text-space-300 text-xs leading-relaxed mt-4">
          We aim to respond within 2–3 business days. For factual corrections to a specific document or
          article, please include the URL and a description of the error. If you are a government source
          with additional context on a released record, let us know — we treat source communications
          confidentially by default.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="glass-panel p-6 my-8">
        <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-white mb-3 uppercase tracking-wider">What to Include</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2">
          <li><strong class="text-white">Corrections:</strong> The page URL and the specific text or metadata that needs fixing.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-white">Tips & new records:</strong> Agency, file ID, release batch, and any source link you can share.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-white">Media inquiries:</strong> Your outlet, deadline, and the angle you are pursuing.</li>
          <li><strong class="text-white">General feedback:</strong> Suggestions for improving navigation, search, or topic coverage.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="glass-panel p-6 my-8">
        <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-white mb-3 uppercase tracking-wider">Editorial Standards</h2>
        <p>
          UFO Declassified is an independent, non-governmental project. We do not have access to classified
          or unreleased materials. All content on this site is based on publicly released U.S. government
          records. We do not pursue conspiracy theories, and we do not publish unverified claims. If you
          are seeking official comment on a UAP matter, please contact the relevant agency directly.
        </p>
      </div>

      <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider">Response Expectations</h2>
      <ul class="space-y-2">
        <li><strong class="text-white">Corrections:</strong> Reviewed and applied within 2–3 business days.</li>
        <li><strong class="text-white">New record suggestions:</strong> Indexed within 1–2 weeks of release, if publicly available.</li>
        <li><strong class="text-white">Media inquiries:</strong> Same-day or next-business-day response.</li>
        <li><strong class="text-white">We do not respond to:</strong> Spam, solicitations for paid placement, or requests to remove legally published public-domain government records.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider">Legal</h2>
      <p class="text-space-300">
        By contacting us, you agree to our <a href="/terms" class="text-cyan-bright hover:underline">Terms of Service</a>
        and acknowledge our <a href="/privacy" class="text-cyan-bright hover:underline">Privacy Policy</a>.
        We do not share your email or inquiry content with third parties except as required by law.
      </p>

    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
